{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_8001_p", "source_sha256": "104ae951b4dcf364657684b16cfd753edd683f714d78def06eecb7d71738f148", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア企画。\n舞姫の衣装に着替えた莉緒は……ノリノリだ）", "zh": "（偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真特辑。\n换上舞姬服装的莉绪……兴致高涨）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_8002_046rio", "source_sha256": "54f3be7ef240912365009192b641b358fb4c59adad14fcde33a31148395a5c52", "ja": "フフッ。{$P$}くん、わかってる\nじゃない♪　私に合わせるなら、やっぱり水着よね！", "zh": "呵呵。{$P$}，你很懂嘛♪ 要配合我的话，果然还是泳装最合适吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_8003_046rio", "source_sha256": "eaad2bded1d1181e3e3da8b30c35f37b7e21986f5c1e270d7049040dfa4f9c08", "ja": "舞姫って言うだけあって、清楚で可愛い感じだけど……\n任せておいて、完璧に着こなして見せるわ！", "zh": "不愧是舞姬，感觉清纯又可爱，不过……交给我吧，我会把它完美地穿出风采给你看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_8004_p", "source_sha256": "67816defb359f2c2d0ca9bb2787ba393a160f6b2de4965c4be9692d59cb32548", "ja": "ああ、頼んだぞ。莉緒に任せると決めた時点で、\nあまり心配はしてないけどな。", "zh": "啊，那就拜托你了。既然决定交给莉绪，我倒也没怎么担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_8005_046rio", "source_sha256": "6c375f20f6d1a7fafc3b361d754bdafeccb86fa410936e25e02103dc87e05b3b", "ja": "そうそう！　{$P$}くんに聞いて\nおきたかったの。どんな私を期待してるのかなって。", "zh": "对对！我想问问{$P$}君，想看看你期待着怎样的我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_8006_p", "source_sha256": "eafebb3d4dfa01040c6ad076c26a606b493deb236ca9c1ea19e091e38da81827", "ja": "どんなか……。そうだな。衣装の魅力を引き出して、\n更には莉緒の新たな魅力を見せてくれたらいいな。", "zh": "要说是哪种……嗯。要是能展现出服装的魅力，同时还能展现出莉绪全新的魅力，那就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_8007_046rio", "source_sha256": "66dc791a6e92385a1795d2757d7351d9ee35a2d07a271d465f8e983de6cd6ce6", "ja": "わかったわ、{$P$}くん。\nその信頼を裏切らない活躍を見せてあげる！", "zh": "知道了，{$P$}君。\n我会拿出不辜负这份信任的表现给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_8008_p", "source_sha256": "c096885b80ef8275a4f375fe4bacef81c06fecd4ff084f8cb2e1335ecfcde41b", "ja": "まあ、張り切りすぎないように……。\nあっ。莉緒にひとつ頼みたいことがあるんだ。", "zh": "嗯，别太过兴奋了……。\n啊，我有件事想拜托莉绪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_8009", "source_sha256": "dff212252954de10044a1b84e553597fb1e996b1abaad3836e02985f6ea0f406", "ja": "落ち着きを持とう", "zh": "保持冷静吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_8010", "source_sha256": "ed41f224f9a36f38d99a5fc283046e7172603075d0af8033f6310699610d1d39", "ja": "もっと可愛さを！", "zh": "更加可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_8011", "source_sha256": "3a5746136cb70caf9531a00fda4151bbe90b867e1c51c2c0e5f6b65cb8477010", "ja": "更なるセクシーを！", "zh": "追求更极致的性感！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_8100_p", "source_sha256": "58e5f340eed43b08490989cc4e42e2700385d63f8f26919817545c0be89b0826", "ja": "衣装と莉緒の魅力を最大限引き出すために、\n少し落ち着いた雰囲気を出すのは、どうだろう？", "zh": "为了将衣装和莉緒的魅力发挥到极致，\n营造出稍微沉稳一点的氛围，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_8101_046rio", "source_sha256": "53b84715027608cd12f234d6e3a3150f738ff67137e1994f40311d3d070f63bb", "ja": "なるほどね。可愛らしさに潜む大人っぽい雰囲気……\nってところかしら！？　ウフフ、燃えてきたわ～！", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，要展现可爱之中潜藏的成熟气质……对吧！？呵呵，我已经燃起来了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_8102_046rio", "source_sha256": "c59c72ebca52b9e809f71189f5950989040c17230e7be15c16429643e3743ee4", "ja": "誰にも真似できない、本物のセクシーを見せてあげる♪\n私、もう止まらないから……ね？", "zh": "让你见识一下谁都无法模仿的、真正的性感♪\n我已经停不下来了……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_8200_p", "source_sha256": "6de09ec69f04e4469558980e5b543ff5a270a0780de267b1f6a86c7628d06997", "ja": "舞姫らしいイメージに合わせて、\nもっと可愛さ……可憐さを押し出してみないか？", "zh": "为了符合舞姬般的形象，要不要试着更多突出可爱……或者说，惹人怜爱的一面？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_8201_046rio", "source_sha256": "279b6cef4364510c6933c2984da6d13daa6ec71b9e5206b2f4115998f4f08b8b", "ja": "確かに……。セクシーを強く意識しちゃうと、\nこの衣装の雰囲気やイメージに合わないものね。", "zh": "确实……。如果太刻意强调性感，\n就和这套服装的氛围与形象不搭了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_8202_046rio", "source_sha256": "ff917c0b36a0c1a4edd3e068730da619ccf2d9d4fb6e797e426735774853a002", "ja": "ここは大人として、頑張っちゃおうかしら。いつも\nとは違う、可愛い系の私で……ドキッとさせてあげる♪", "zh": "这里就以成熟大人的身份，努力一下吧。展现出和平时不一样的可爱风格，让你心动一下♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_8300_p", "source_sha256": "0780baa7ea15252e651ee2df489d925eb512e3e48bdbc5c90a7d953e31c3a22d", "ja": "更なるセクシーを追い求めよう！　莉緒だったら、\nどんな時でも最高のセクシーを貫けるはずだから！", "zh": "让我们追求更极致的性感吧！因为莉緒无论何时，都能展现出最完美的性感！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_8301_046rio", "source_sha256": "7ae63c9ddb9dfd38cabd5ff8ebe49c6567d3e279d01d5141b6860a112384abd3", "ja": "そんなことを言ってもらえる日が来るなんて……\n嬉しいわ！　でもね、{$P$}くん。", "zh": "没想到竟然会有听到你这么说的一天……  \n我好开心！不过，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_8302_046rio", "source_sha256": "7b3f2edc69191bf469eacea012e414b53de13d7942095c4d53f74ed1b3a6f6d9", "ja": "それは今じゃないと思うの。セクシーの神髄を\n理解してくれたって思ったんだけど、まだみたいね。", "zh": "我觉得现在还不是时候。还以为你已经理解了性感的真谛，看来还没有呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
